.TH SPRAWL 6 "October 2026" "Sprawl 0.3.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
sprawl \- a small, keyboard-first pixel-art city builder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sprawl
[\fB\-seed\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-config\fR \fIpath\fR] [\fB\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lay roads, zone residential, commercial and industrial land, connect power
and water, add services and balance the budget while the city grows.
Without options the game opens on its title screen.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-seed " N"
Seed for the first generated map.
.TP
.BI \-config " path"
Configuration file (default \fI~/.config/sprawl/config.toml\fR).
.TP
.B \-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-screenshot " file.png"
Render one 1280x800 frame to a PNG and exit (with \fB\-actions\fR and
\fB\-ticks\fR to script it).
.SH KEYS
Press \fB?\fR in the game for the full list. Highlights:
.TP
.B Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+N, Ctrl+Q
Save, open, new city, quit.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Shift+Z
Undo, redo.
.TP
.B r p w d, z r/c/i, b
Road, power line, water pipe, bulldoze, zones, buildings.
.TP
.B h j k l / arrows, + -, Space, 1 2 3
Move, zoom, pause, speed.
.TP
.B Esc
Back out, or open the menu.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sprawl/config.toml
Settings and key bindings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/sprawl/
Saved cities (\fI*.city\fR) and the autosave.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SPRAWL_THEME_DIR
Read the colour theme from this directory instead of the active Omarchy
theme.
